  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Export Credit Insurance Program (NSCE) by ABGF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Nuevo Seguro de Cr&#xE9;dito a la Exportaci&#xF3;n (NSCE) de la ABGF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enable ABGF to implement the NSCE by creating a self-sustainable model for providing export credit guarantees, aiming to overcome the long-standing challenges associated with the mechanism while also expanding access to NSCE for MSMEs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Permitir que el ABGF viabilize el NSCE creando un modelo autosostenible de provisi&#xF3;n de garant&#xED;a al cr&#xE9;dito a la exportaci&#xF3;n, con el fin de superar la larga historia que acompa&#xF1;a al mecanismo, adem&#xE1;s de promover mayor acceso de los MPMEs al NSCE</narrative>
  </description>
